        "en": "Suppose array int a[10] (Pascal: a: array[0..9] of longint) contains 10 distinct integers. The program segment below tries to implement insertion sort to sort the array in ascending order. However, the program contains an error that can be fixed by changing exactly one line. Find the line and correct it. You may assume variables i, j, and t are declared as int (Pascal: longint)."
      },
      "points": 2,
      "blanks": [
